---
layout: base.njk
title: 归档
description: 所有文章的时间线
pageType: archive
pageSubtitle: 一页页翻过曾经的日子
permalink: /archives/
---
{% from "icon.njk" import icon %}
<section id="archive" class="page-card">
  <div class="article-sort">
    <div class="article-sort-title">文章总览 - {{ collections.posts | length }}</div>
    {% if collections.posts.length == 0 %}
    <div class="empty-posts"><h2>暂无文章</h2><p>以后写下的文章会按时间线整理在这里。</p></div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="article-sort-item year"><strong>2026</strong></div>
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <article class="article-sort-item">
      <a class="article-sort-item-img" href="{{ post.url | url }}"><img src="{{ post.data.cover | url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></a>
      <div class="article-sort-item-info"><time datetime="{{ post.date }}">{{ icon("calendar") }} {{ post.date | dateCN }}</time><a class="article-sort-item-title" href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{% include "sidebar.njk" %}
